WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
WebhookScope opens on the demo bot. The verdict reads: WEBHOOK — STOLEN.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
A radar graphic shows the stolen verdict in red.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
The fingerprint names the claimant: an n8n workflow.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Evidence on screen: 47 updates pending, last error 502 Bad Gateway, three days ago.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
The timeline shows the queue growing while the bot stays silent.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.000
The fix: give n8n its own bot in BotFather, then restart the poller.
